<resources>

    <!-- S-05 Disclaimer -->
    <string name="s05_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="s05_bullet_1">LightScout is not a medical device. It shows data from your Nightscout and does not replace your diabetes team\'s advice.</string>
    <string name="s05_bullet_2">LightScout alarms are a second layer of protection. Keep the alarms on the pump and the sensor turned on.</string>
    <string name="s05_bullet_3">LightScout never delivers insulin. A bolus you log is only a note in Nightscout.</string>
    <string name="s05_bullet_4">Readings can be late or missing when the phone, the internet, Nightscout or the uploader has a problem.</string>
    <string name="s05_bullet_5">You use LightScout at your own risk.</string>
